The results of \cite{arxivID-1411.2664-0, arxivID-1511.02513-1}, and their subsequent extensions, have been applied to a wide variety of problems in machine learning, including empirical risk minimization \cite{arxivID-1405.7085-2}, deep learning \cite{arxivID-1607.00133-3}, and reinforcement learning \cite{arxivID-1603.02010-4}.

